{"id": "3237681", "revid": "41997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3237681", "title": "Vasile Simiocenco", "text": "Vasile Simiocenco, men\u021bionat uneori Vasile Simioncenco, () un rom\u00e2n de sprint care a concurat \u00een anii 1970. A c\u00e2\u0219tigat \u0219apte medalii la : una de aur (K-4 10000 m: ), dou\u0103 de argint (K-4 500 m: , K-4 10000 m: ) \u0219i patru de bronz (K-1 4 x 500 m: , K-2 1000 m: 1971, K-2 10000 m: , K-4 10000 m: 1973).\nSimiocenco a participat, de asemenea, la dou\u0103 Jocuri Olimpice de var\u0103, ob\u021bin\u00e2nd cel mai bun rezultat al s\u0103u, un loc patru \u00een proba de de la Montreal, \u00een 1976."}
